      "aiNotes": "Aircraft owner. Format: 3 characters (airline code format).\n\nFor leased aircraft:\n- airline_designator = Operating carrier\n- aircraft_owner = Owning carrier\n\nExample:\n- Operating: VA (Virgin Australia)\n- Owner: SQ (Singapore Airlines)\n→ VA operates SQ-owned aircraft\n\nBlank if operator owns aircraft.",
